    {
      "id": "2f1f93c5-91f5-54ad-9874-148184b43c0e",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 3,
      "x": 340,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "열심히 했는데 제자리걸음인 것 같아요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I worked hard, but it feels like I'm going nowhere.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c9c356cb-e458-557c-b769-f17cf1d559d6",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "{name}의 목소리에 힘이 없다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "There's no strength in {name}'s voice.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "99eb6453-5eaf-5a1f-8be0-3b703306c692",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "오전 만남 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "2f1f93c5-91f5-54ad-9874-148184b43c0e"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "73733f45-394a-5c13-8261-7f0c7731e680": "talk",
        "98c33065-9964-5240-9d07-146189489eda": -1,
        "1730a761-931b-55bf-a992-6d737f7b641b": 0,
        "75ad639f-5f34-5573-912a-992e5744af19": "ups<1",
        "ba5f778b-0cac-56be-ad81-5e60aa289e2a": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4753f212-0621-5212-beb0-660db1ca16e6",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a463ede6-f981-5459-95f0-62f24bb07529",
          "text": "쌓이고 있는 거야. 결과는 나중에 와.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "72b42c6f-ab06-5008-8f16-97cb4c7777dc": "ok>trust:+3;ok>stress:-5;ng>stress:+3"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "7f6d92c6-50f5-5b85-abba-dc16d7dcafad",
          "text": "방법을 바꿔 보자. 같이 고민해 줄게.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "72b42c6f-ab06-5008-8f16-97cb4c7777dc": "trust:+4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "3fc741e4-3ec1-51fc-b87d-8b0ad3836288",
          "text": "다들 그래. 넘어가자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "72b42c6f-ab06-5008-8f16-97cb4c7777dc": "trust:-2"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:a463ede6-f981-5459-95f0-62f24bb07529": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "It's adding up. Results come later.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:7f6d92c6-50f5-5b85-abba-dc16d7dcafad": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Let's change the approach. I'll think it through with you.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:3fc741e4-3ec1-51fc-b87d-8b0ad3836288": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Everyone goes through it. Let's move on.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bf75dec0-9d13-588a-916b-a1a11e0f8baa",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…그 말 믿어 볼게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "...I'll trust you on that.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "be0e6492-09f6-5493-b11f-6eb0513e78f6": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5732db9c-678f-54df-8c97-bb92dcac3f46",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "그 말, 매번 하시잖아요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You say that every time.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "be0e6492-09f6-5493-b11f-6eb0513e78f6": "ng"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "16e1c392-60d2-5b6d-910b-dc1b0c3f7def",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "정말요? 그럼 내일 영상 같이 봐 주세요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Really? Then please review the footage with me tomorrow.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "727d5044-d433-5ae9-8291-19131512d8cf",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 10,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 300,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…네.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "...Okay.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
